# FLAT·SIX — design system

Inline styles, no CSS framework. Match the existing look exactly.

- **Type:** body `'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif`; mono labels/values
  `'JetBrains Mono',monospace` (uppercase, letter-spaced).
- **Color:** red `var(--red)`/`#D5001C`; ink `#0B0B0C`; greys `#6E6E73`,
  `#9A9AA0`, `#B4B4B8`; border `#E3E3E5`; page bg `#ECECEE`.
- **Surfaces:** page bg is grey; **content sits on white cards** (`#fff`,
  `1px solid #E3E3E5`, radius 4–6). Result/verdict boxes are **white with a
  tone-colored border** — never a filled tinted background.
- **Reuse primitives:** `components/tools/ui.tsx` (`InfoBox`, `Stat`,
  `NumberField`, `FieldGrid`, `ToolSection`) and `components/tools/diagrams.tsx`
  for SVG visuals. Prefer a diagram where it aids understanding.
- **Responsive (test at 375 px):** root views use `className="padView"`;
  3-col grids use `stackSm`; input grids use `repeat(auto-fit,minmax(N,1fr))`;
  chip/toggle rows use `flexWrap:'wrap'`; tab/segment bars use `overflowX:'auto'`.
- **Number inputs:** native spinners are hidden globally — use a unit suffix.
- **Nav = route:** `app/<name>/page.tsx` → `<AppShell>` + register in
  `Sidebar.tsx` `NAV` and `AppShell.tsx` `PAGE_META`. Views are `'use client'`,
  read the car via `useVehicle()`, derive generation via `generationForBody()`.
